    "signpost": "finally",
    "function": "sequence",
    "source_turn_preview_server_only": "Finally, scientific understanding and safe practice must be kept together. A pleasant smell or attractive colour does not prove food is safe. Commercial producers rely on monitored processes, hygiene and suitable testing. For consumers, the appropriate conclusion is to use validated methods, rather than improvising an untested procedure with perishable ingredients. Fermentation is powerful precisely because microbes can transform food."
